{"id": "DfE00SmRtix", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Why did Hanuman ji FORGET his own powers? 🐒 Because baby Hanuman was SO naughty, the rishis cursed him! 😄\n\nAfter the gods gave him their boons, nothing could hurt baby Hanuman, and the rishis' ashram paid for it. Valmiki's Ramayana (Uttara Kanda) says he tore their bark clothes and broke their yagna ladles and pots. The rishis forgave him again and again because of Brahma's boon. Maa Anjana, Papa Kesari and even Vayu Dev told him to stop. He didn't listen 🙈\n\nSo the rishis cursed him, \"but not too angrily\": he would forget his strength for a long, long time. And the naughtiest baby became the gentlest.\n\nYears later, at the edge of the ocean, no vanara could leap to Lanka to find Maa Sita. Hanuman sat quietly. He had forgotten. Then old Jambavan reminded him who he was: \"You once leapt for the SUN!\" And Hanuman remembered. 🔥 Jai Bajrangbali! 🙏\n\nWhat's the naughtiest thing YOU did as a kid? Tell us in the comments 👇 Save this for bedtime and share it with a little Hanuman in your family!\n\n📚 Our picture books for little ones: Books 1–3, set of 3 for ₹500 at rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\n#hanuman #hanumanji #balhanuman #jaibajrangbali #jaihanuman #ramayan #ramayana #valmikiramayan #jambavan #hindumythology #indianmythology #kidsstories #bedtimestories #sanatandharma #rishikatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1793270876, "like_count": 34983, "comment_count": 127, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1463851545846013a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 57.36, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNsq7Wo1TA12dfv9PPBypqGQJMXxjvqZ5PzmADe2nKNqwa9Solz9UlQ8O88Pyv7XJ-zGMXf6TWD5REvRNC3OPFBV3mdlre7ee_K3ic.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=Adq25eagQvhKbiROf1XKPOSk